    <script>
    // =============================================================================
    //  QUAN™ FOAM v23.5 – UNIFIED P2P SWARM + ALL FEATURES FROM v22.29
    //  Harmonised synthesis: every capability from both versions is preserved.
    //  Added: Testnet Faucet automation (ethers.js wallet gen + faucet redirect).
